 "H7 timelike QNEI (Thm III.1): globally hyperbolic (M,g); FREE Klein-Gordon field (minimally coupled; 'Klein-Gordon field of mass m >= 0'); Hadamard states; g smooth real compactly supported; normal ordering relative to a Hadamard reference state omega_0 (bound depends on omega_0); proof 'identical to' Fewster CQG 17 1897 (2000) [14], not reproduced",
